ll it to upgrade their equipment. Whether to borrow the strength of vampires or rely solely on human abilities in battle is up to you. Vampires are classified into various ranks based on their strength, such as Knight, Baron, Viscount, and Duke. Hunt down the strongest vampires and strive to become an S-rank hunter. In the dungeons, you will find merchants such as witches, prisoners, and undertakers who don’t care about your identity as long as you have money. Meet and trade with them. PC Roguelike Action Nunholy Trailers Official Trailer Upcoming Events View all State of Play: September 3, 2025 (007 First Light) September 3 @ 2:00  …[truncated]", "favicon_host": "www.gematsu.com"}